  "description": "FANCAA crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group A e a 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H144 Cl14 Dy8 N4 O13. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 16 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.571-3.819 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.42-115.24°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H144Cl14Dy8N4O13.",
